{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106266","id":2511903384,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6VuJqY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106266","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106266.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106266.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106266","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106266/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106266/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106266/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b05806553339b36dac12e37fd38066b0b067a698","number":106266,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Replace AudioStreamPlayer mix target with output channels","user":{"login":"Joseph-DiGiovanni","id":37851452,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODUxNDUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37851452?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni","html_url":"https://github.com/Joseph-DiGiovanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joseph-DiGiovanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR replaces the limiting `mix_target` options of AudioStreamPlayer with more granular `output_channels`. For example, it is currently not possible to output to only the rear speakers, or only one side. This change allows audio to be output to any combination of speakers, or even just a single one.\r\n\r\nIn addition, I've added a `downmix` option which will take the desired output channels and use a standard downmixing equation to best preserve positional audio when using an output device with fewer channels. This is enabled by default, but can be disabled to only play audio when the desired channel is available. A good use case for disabling it would be a speaker test.\r\n\r\n![Screenshot From 2025-05-10 23-22-01](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86660387-d5c4-45d2-918d-6919d27ecbef)\r\n\r\nWhile a majority of the work is done, I need some assistance _properly_ removing `mix_target` in favor of `output_channels` to not break existing projects. The conversion should be straightforward, but I'm not familiar with that process at all unfortunately.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godot